<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NCI Building as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NCI Building as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wheat First Butcher Singer said it initiated coverage of NCI Building Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/8 to 29-5/8 at 1505 EDT/1905 GMT Friday.</p>
